BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Paper Tiger
DTSTART:20261204T031500Z
DTEND:20261204T052500Z
DTSTAMP:20261204T031500Z
UID:2iwRpNwxxL
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 114 mins (1h54m)\n\nIn James Gray’s deeply felt an
 d intense drama\, two brothers become entangled in a scheme that turns out
  to be too good to be true. As they try to navigate their way through the 
 dangerous world of the Russian mafia\, family bonds begin to fray with lif
 e-altering consequences.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/paper-
 tiger\n\nEstimated start: 19:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
