BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Christmas Pop-Up
DTSTART:20261220T033000Z
DTEND:20261220T052000Z
DTSTAMP:20261220T033000Z
UID:NJGxrLb0fS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nPresented by Blue Egg Films and P
 aper Palace Productions. Desperate for a fresh start\, an unlucky-in-love
  set decorator takes a job designing a Christmas Eve pop-up event for a ja
 ded celebrity chef\, hoping to escape her current hell: living with her ex
  and his new girlfriend… before he proposes on New Year’s Eve.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/christmas-pop-up\n\nEstimated start: 1
 9:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Debut
DTSTART:20261225T235000Z
DTEND:20261226T015000Z
DTSTAMP:20261225T235000Z
UID:lE02LjwXOA
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nIn Jesse Eisenberg’s theater-w
 orld comedy\, Julianne Moore flings herself with delicious abandon into th
 e role of a middle-aged New Jersey housewife who gets a part in a local st
 age musical despite having zero experience.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema
 /in-theaters/the-debut\n\nEstimated start: 16:05
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Werwulf
DTSTART:20261225T204500Z
DTEND:20261225T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261225T204500Z
UID:969kaCgPD9
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nIn a small rural village\, local
  superstition becomes terrifyingly real when a ravenous creature begins to
  stalk the countryside. While a local farmer struggles beneath the weight 
 of a werewolf curse\, a ruthless hunter begins a campaign to eradicate wol
 ves. A harrowing tale of devotion\, damnation and the devil within. Ticke
 ts on sale Tuesday\, November 24\, at 5:00am.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cine
 ma/in-theaters/werwulf\n\nEstimated start: 13:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:All of a Sudden
DTSTART:20261226T024500Z
DTEND:20261226T061500Z
DTSTAMP:20261226T024500Z
UID:8Fx4YL6uR6
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 195 mins (3h15m)\n\nMarie-Lou Fontaine\, director of
  a nursing home in the Paris suburbs\, defies convention by adopting the 
 ‘Humanitude’ method despite her team’s resistance. Her encounter wit
 h Mari Morisaki\, a terminally ill Japanese playwright\, transforms her li
 fe. Together\, they turn the facility into a symbol of resistance and huma
 nity against the system’s limits.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-thea
 ters/all-of-a-sudden\n\nEstimated start: 19:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
